<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραποι-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make falsely</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μέτρα
				καὶ σταθμά</span>
			<i>make false</i> measures and weights, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.78
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ παραποιοῦντες</span>
			<i>forgers</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				73
			</span></i>
			<u>Praef.</u>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραποιησάμενος
				σφραγῖδα</span>
			<i>having got a false</i> seal <i>made</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.132
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">&lt;&gt;ρασημηνάμενος</span>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.27
			</span></i>) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. βίον ἀνθρώπου</span>
			<i>falsify</i> his record, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				2.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>alter slightly</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὄνομα, τὴν
				λέξιν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				5.10
			</span></i>. 
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.70a
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ παραπεποιημένα</span>, e. g.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ παρὰ γράμμα σκώμματα</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1412a28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>adopt as one's own by altering, imitate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				12.513a
			</span></i> : abs., <i>make a parody</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				32.81
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρ᾽ ὑπόνοιαν παραποιηθὲν
			ἐκ</span> . . Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				782
			</span></i> : abs., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.854.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>introduce as an episode</i> into a poem, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ </span>( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθ᾽ ἂ</span>
			)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> παρεποίησε</span> (prob. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ γὰρ ἐποίησε</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.116
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1611.165
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				175
			</span></i> (prob. l.).</div>
